INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('expeor/aws-automation/tdd-workflow', 'tdd-workflow', 'expeor', 'aws-automation', 'community', 'tdd-workflow expeor aws-automation community The tdd-workflow skill provides a test-driven development guide for AWS automation, supporting multi-account and region setups. It helps developers follow the Iron Law of TDD. TDD 工作流程是一种测试驱动开发方法，通过自动化测试实现高质量代码 TDD ワークフローは、自動化テストを使用して高品質なコードを実現するテスト駆動開発方法です TDD 워크플로우는 자동화 테스트를 사용하여 높은 품질의 코드를 구현하는 테스트 주도 개발 방법입니다 El flujo de trabajo TDD es una guía para la automatización de pruebas con AWS CLI y Excel Le flux de travail TDD est un guide pour l''automatisation des tests avec AWS CLI et Excel Der TDD-Workflow ist ein Leitfaden für die Automatisierung von Tests mit AWS CLI und Excel O fluxo de trabalho TDD é uma abordagem de desenvolvimento de software que prioriza a escrita de testes antes do código Поток работы TDD - это подход к разработке программного обеспечения, который отдает предпочтение написанию тестов перед кодом تدفق عمل TDD هو نهج في تطوير البرمجيات يؤكد على كتابة الاختبارات قبل الكود how to use tdd-workflow tdd-workflow setup guide test-driven development for AWS Red-Green-Refactor workflow tdd-workflow vs traditional testing automating testing with tdd-workflow tdd-workflow install what is tdd-workflow tdd-workflow alternative TDD 工作流程 自动化测试 AWS 自动化 CLI 测试驱动开发 Red-Green-Refactor 软件开发方法 AIエージェント Enforces the Iron Law of TDD: NO PRODUCTION CODE WITHOUT A FAILING TEST FIRST Supports Red-Green-Refactor workflow for test-driven development Automates testing for AWS projects with multi-account and region support Generates Excel reports for test results Follows a strict testing philosophy: write tests before writing code tdd-workflow is a test-driven development approach that enforces the Iron Law, ensuring no production code is written without a failing test first.');
