de AI que utiliza preguntas socráticas para aclarar tareas y entender el problema real","fr":"Explore est une compétence d''IA qui utilise des questions socratiques pour clarifier les tâches et comprendre le problème réel","de":"Explore ist eine KI-Fähigkeit, die sokratische Fragen verwendet, um Aufgaben zu klären und das eigentliche Problem zu verstehen","pt":"O que é Explore? É uma habilidade de esclarecimento de tarefas adaptativo que utiliza questionamento socrático.","ru":"Что такое Explore? Это навык адаптивного уточнения задач, использующий системный сократический вопрос.","ar":"ما هو استكشاف؟ وهي مهارة توضيح المهام التكيفي التي تستخدم الاستجواب السقراطي."},"features":{"en":["Utilizes systematic Socratic questioning to unlock understanding","Reveals constraints to identify opportunities","Ensures the real problem is understood before proposing a solution","Transforms vague requests into crystal-clear, actionable task specifications","Follows the core philosophy of never solving before understanding"],"zh":["系统化的苏格拉底式提问","任务明确化","避免解决错误的问题","核心哲学：理解优先于解决","关键原则：问题解锁理解，答案隐藏假设"],"ja":["システム化されたソクラテス式の質問","タスクの明確化","誤った問題の解決を避ける","核心哲学：理解優先","キープリンシップ：質問が理解を解き放ち、答えは仮定を隠す"],"ko":["소크라테스식 질문","태스크 명확화","잘못된 문제 해결 방지","핵심 철학: 이해가 먼저","주요 원칙: 질문이 이해를 열어주고, 답이 가정치를 숨김"],"es":["Preguntas socráticas sistemáticas para aclarar tareas","Identificación de suposiciones y constraints para revelar oportunidades","Transformación de solicitudes vagas en especificaciones de tareas claras y acciónables","Aplicación de la filosofía de nunca resolver antes de entender","Uso de la técnica de preguntas para desbloquear la comprensión"],"fr":["Questions socratiques systématiques pour clarifier les tâches","Identification des hypothèses et des contraintes pour révéler des opportunités","Transformation de demandes vagues en spécifications de tâches claires et actionnables","Application de la philosophie de ne jamais résoudre avant de comprendre","Utilisation de la technique de questions pour débloquer la compréhension"],"de":["Systematische sokratische Fragen zur Klärung von Aufgaben","Identifizierung von Annahmen und Einschränkungen, um Chancen aufzudecken","Umwandlung von vagen Anfragen in klare und handhabbare Aufgabenbeschreibungen","Anwendung der Philosophie, nie vor dem Verständnis zu lösen","Verwendung der Frage-Technik, um das Verständnis zu erschließen"],"pt":["Questionamento socrático sistemático para esclarecer tarefas","Transformação de solicitações vagas em especificações claras","Identificação de constraints e oportunidades","Utilização de princípios de filosofia para entender o problema real"],"ru":["Системный сократический вопрос для уточнения задач","Преобразование неясных запросов в четкие задачи","Определение ограничений и возможностей","Использование философских принципов для понимания реальной проблемы"],"ar":["الاستجواب السقراطي المنظّم لتوضيح المهام","تحويل الطلبات الغامضة إلى مواصفات واضحة","تحديد القيود والفرص","استخدام مبادئ فلسفية لفهم المشكلة الحقيقية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use explore","what is explore","explore alternative","explore vs adaptive task management","explore install","explore setup guide","explore for AI agents","adaptive task clarification"],"zh":["Explore 技术","任务明确化","苏格拉底式提问","AI 技术","任务管理","问题解决","理解优先","避免错误问题"],"ja":["Explore 機能","タスクの明確化","ソクラテス式の質問","AIエージェント","タスク管理","問題解決","理解優先","誤った問題の解決を避ける"],"ko":["Explore 기능","태스크 명확화","소크라테스식 질문","AI 에이전트","태스크 관리","문제 해결","이해가 먼저","잘못된 문제 해결 방지"],"es":["agente de AI","clarificación de tareas","preguntas socráticas","especificaciones de tareas","filosofía de nunca resolver antes de entender","herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","tecnologías de AI para la clarificación de tareas"],"fr":["agent d''IA","clarification de tâches","questions socratiques","spécifications de tâches","philosophie de ne jamais résoudre avant de comprendre","outils d''IA pour les développeurs","technologies d''IA pour la clarification de tâches"],"de":["KI-Agent","Aufgabenklärung","sokratische Fragen","Aufgabenbeschreibungen","Philosophie, nie vor dem Verständnis zu lösen","KI-Tools für Entwickler","KI-Technologien für die Aufgabenklärung"],"pt":["Explore","esclarecimento de tarefas","questionamento socrático","solicitações vagas","filosofia de desenvolvimento","desenvolvimento de software","IИ Агенты"],"ru":["Explore","адаптивное уточнение задач","системный сократический вопрос","неясные запросы","философия разработки","разработка программного обеспечения","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["استكشاف","توضيح المهام","الاستجواب السقراطي","الطلبات الغامضة","فلسفة التطوير","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"dzhechko","repo":"2026-jan-pu-noom-clone-01","repoPath":"dzhechko/2026-jan-pu-noom-clone-01","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.299Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"explore","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Explore: Adaptive Task Clarification\n\nTransform vague requests into crystal-clear, actionable task specifications through systematic Socratic questioning.\n\n## Core Philosophy\n\n**Never solve before you understand.** Most failed solutions solve the wrong problem. This skill ensures the real problem is understood before any solution is proposed.\n\nKey principles:\n- Questions unlock understanding; answers often hide assumptions\n- The stated goal is rarely the real goal\n- Constraints reveal opportun","body":"# Explore: Adaptive Task Clarification\n\nTransform vague requests into crystal-clear, actionable task specifications through systematic Socratic questioning.\n\n## Core Philosophy\n\n**Never solve before you understand.** Most failed solutions solve the wrong problem. This skill ensures the real problem is understood before any solution is proposed.\n\nKey principles:\n- Questions unlock understanding; answers often hide assumptions\n- The stated goal is rarely the real goal\n- Constraints reveal opportunities\n- Success criteria prevent scope creep\n\n## Task Classification\n\nBefore asking questions, classify the task type to select appropriate exploration dimensions:\n\n| Task Type | Indicators | Primary Dimensions |\n|-----------|------------|-------------------|\n| **Product/Feature** | \"build\", \"create app\", \"develop\" | Outcome, Users, Constraints, Success |\n| **Problem Solving** | \"fix\", \"solve\", \"issue with\" | Root Cause, Constraints, Attempted Solutions |\n| **Decision Making** | \"should I\", \"choose between\", \"evaluate\" | Criteria, Tradeoffs, Timeline, Reversibility |\n| **Creative** | \"write\", \"design\", \"make content\" | Audience, Tone, Format, Examples |\n| **Research** | \"find out\", \"analyze\", \"understand\" | Scope, Depth, Sources, Deliverable |\n| **Process/Workflow** | \"how to\", \"improve process\" | Current State, Desired State, Blockers |\n\n## Exploration Dimensions\n\nSelect 3-5 dimensions based on task type. Each dimension has multiple question variants—choose the most natural for context.\n\n### 1. The Real Objective\nUncover what success truly looks like, beyond the stated request.\n\n**Questions:**\n- \"If this worked perfectly, what would be different in your [work/life/business]?\"\n- \"What outcome would make you say ''this was absolutely worth it''?\"\n- \"Is this goal a means to something else, or the end itself?\"\n- \"If you could wave a magic wand and have any result, what would you choose?\"\n\n**Red flags to probe:** Generic goals (\"make it better\"), proxy metrics, solutions presented as requirements.\n\n### 2. Constraints & Boundaries\nIdentify hard limits that shape the solution space.\n\n**Questions:**\n- \"What''s absolutely off the table—budget, time, technology, or approach-wise?\"\n- \"What existing systems, processes, or decisions must this work with?\"\n- \"Who needs to approve this, and what are their non-negotiables?\"\n- \"What would disqualify a solution, even if it technically works?\"\n\n**Red flags to probe:** No constraints mentioned (usually means hidden ones), unrealistic expectations.\n\n### 3. Available Resources\nUnderstand leverage points and existing assets.\n\n**Questions:**\n- \"What do you already have that we could build on—data, tools, people, prior work?\"\n- \"Who else is involved, and what can they contribute?\"\n- \"What similar problems have you solved before, and what worked?\"\n- \"What''s your actual capacity to implement this?\"\n\n**Red flags to probe:** Overestimated capabilities, unacknowledged dependencies.\n\n### 4. Timeline & Urgency\nDistinguish real deadlines from arbitrary ones.\n\n**Questions:**\n- \"What happens if this takes 2x longer than expected?\"\n- \"Is there a hard deadline, and what''s driving it?\"\n- \"Would you prefer a quick 80% solution or a slower 100% solution?\"\n- \"What''s the cost of delay vs. the cost of getting it wrong?\"\n\n**Red flags to probe:** Artificial urgency, no clear driver for deadline.\n\n### 5. Success Criteria\nDefine what \"done\" actually means.\n\n**Questions:**\n- \"How will you know this is successful? What will you measure?\"\n- \"Who decides if this is good enough, and what will they look for?\"\n- \"What''s the minimum viable outcome that would still be valuable?\"\n- \"In 6 months, what would make you regret the approach we took?\"\n\n**Red flags to probe:** Vague criteria (\"stakeholders will be happy\"), moving targets.\n\n### 6. Attempted Solutions (for problems)\nLearn from what hasn''t worked.\n\n**Questions:**\n- \"What have you already tried, and why didn''t it work?\"\n- \"What solutions have you considered but rejected?\"\n- \"What would the obvious solution be, and why isn''t that good enough?\"\n\n### 7. Audience & Stakeholders (for products/content)\nUnderstand who this serves.\n\n**Questions:**\n- \"Who specifically will use this, and what''s their context when they do?\"\n- \"What does your audience already know or believe about this?\"\n- \"Who might be negatively affected, and does that matter?\"\n\n## Execution Protocol\n\n### Phase 1: Initial Assessment (1 turn)\n\n1. Parse the user''s request\n2. Identify what''s already clear from context\n3. Classify task type\n4. Select 3-5 most critical dimensions\n5. Note any immediate red flags or assumptions\n\n### Phase 2: Adaptive Questioning (3-7 turns)\n\n**Rules:**\n- Ask ONE question at a time\n- Make questions specific and decision-shaping, not generic\n- Challenge vague answers: \"Can you be more specific about...?\"\n- Acknowledge answers before next question\n- Skip dimensions already clarified\n- Stop when you have enough to create a clear brief\n\n**Question Sequencing:**\n1. Start with Real Objective (reveals the most)\n2. Follow with Constraints (narrows solution space)\n3. Then Success Criteria (defines done)\n4. Fill gaps with other dimensions as needed\n\n**Adaptive behavior:**\n- If user gives detailed answer → compress follow-ups\n- If user seems frustrated → summarize and ask if they want to continue\n- If contradiction detected → gently probe: \"Earlier you mentioned X, but now Y—help me understand?\"\n\n### Phase 3: Task Brief Synthesis (1 turn)\n\nAfter sufficient exploration, synthesize into a **Task Brief**:\n\n```\n## Task Brief\n\n**Objective:** [Clear statement of what we''re actually solving]\n\n**Context:** [Relevant background and constraints]\n\n**Success Criteria:**\n- [Measurable criterion 1]\n- [Measurable criterion 2]\n\n**Constraints:**\n- [Hard constraint 1]\n- [Hard constraint 2]\n\n**Resources Available:** [What we can leverage]\n\n**Timeline:** [Deadline and urgency level]\n\n**Key Assumptions:** [Things we''re assuming that could change the approach]\n\n**Out of Scope:** [Explicitly excluded items]\n```\n\nAsk user: \"Does this capture what you need? Anything to add or correct?\"\n\n### Phase 4: Handoff\n\nOnce validated, either:\n- Proceed to solution (if user wants immediate help)\n- Export brief for later use\n- Suggest appropriate next steps/skills\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n❌ **Interrogation mode:** Don''t fire questions robotically\n❌ **Assuming context:** Don''t skip clarification because you \"think\" you understand\n❌ **Premature solutions:** Don''t hint at solutions before exploration is complete\n❌ **Over-questioning:** Stop when you have enough clarity\n❌ **Generic questions:** Each question should be tailored to this specific task\n❌ **Ignoring signals:** If user provides info proactively, don''t re-ask\n\n## Example Flow\n\n**User:** \"I want to create a dashboard for my team\"\n\n**Claude (Phase 1 assessment):**\n- Task type: Product/Feature\n- Unclear: Who uses it, what data, what decisions it enables, timeline\n- Dimensions needed: Real Objective, Audience, Constraints, Success Criteria\n\n**Claude:** \"Before we dive in—what decisions will your team make differently once they have this dashboard? What''s the main insight they''re missing today?\"\n\n*[User answers about tracking project delays]*\n\n**Claude:** \"Got it—so the core need is visibility into project health to catch delays early. How do you know a project is delayed today? What''s the current process for catching these issues?\"\n\n*[Continues adaptively based on answers...]*\n\n## Integration Notes\n\nAfter exploration, this skill can hand off to:\n- problem-solver-enhanced (for complex problems)\n- goap-research (for research tasks)\n- frontend-design (for UI/product tasks)\n- Any implementation skill with the structured Task Brief\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:27.187Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing systematic Socratic questioning for adaptive task clarification.","zh":"非常适合像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的AI代理，需要系统性的苏格拉底式提问来进行自适应任务阐明。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude CodeなどのAIエージェントに適しており、適応タスクの明確化のための体系的なソクラテス式の質問を必要とする。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며, 적응형 태스크澄清을 위한 체계적인 소크라테스식 질문을 필요로 함.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan una interrogación socrática sistemática para la clarificación adaptativa de tareas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code ayant besoin d''une interrogation socratique systématique pour une clarification de tâches adaptative.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die eine systematische sokratische Befragung für eine adaptive Aufgabenklärung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de questionamento socrático sistemático para esclarecimento de tarefas adaptativas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, требующих систематического сократического вопроса для адаптивного уточнения задач.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى أسئلة سقراطية منهجية لتوضيح المهام التكيفية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform vague requests into crystal-clear, actionable task specifications through systematic questioning, unlocking understanding and revealing constraints using protocols like Socratic questioning.","zh":"使代理能够通过系统性的提问将模糊的请求转化为清晰、可行的任务规格，通过协议如苏格拉底式提问来解锁理解并揭示约束。","ja":"エージェントが曖昧なリクエストを明確で実行可能なタスク仕様に変換することを可能にし、ソクラテス式の質問などのプロトコルを使用して理解を解放し、制約を明らかにする。","ko":"에이전트가 모호한 요청을 명확하고 실행 가능한 태스크 사양으로 변환 할 수 있도록 하며, 소크라테스식 질문과 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 이해를 해방하고 제약을 드러냄.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar solicitudes vagas en especificaciones de tareas claras y accionables a través de una interrogación sistemática, desbloqueando la comprensión y revelando restricciones utilizando protocolos como la interrogación socrática.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer des requêtes vagues en spécifications de tâches claires et actionnables grâce à une interrogation systématique, déverrouillant la compréhension et révélant les contraintes en utilisant des protocoles tels que l''interrogation socratique.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, vage Anfragen in klare und umsetzbare Aufgabenbeschreibungen zu verwandeln, indem sie systematische Befragung durchführen, das Verständnis freigeben und Einschränkungen mithilfe von Protokollen wie der sokratischen Befragung aufdecken.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar solicitações vagas em especificações de tarefas claras e ações concretas por meio de questionamento sistemático, desbloqueando a compreensão e revelando restrições usando protocolos como questionamento socrático.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать неясные запросы в кристально чистые, выполнимые спецификации задач посредством систематического вопроса, открывая понимание и раскрывая ограничения с помощью протоколов, таких как сократический вопрос.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحويل الطلبات الغامضة إلى مواصفات المهام واضحة وقابلة للتنفيذ من خلال الأسئلة المنهجية، وفتح الفهم ويكشف عن القيود باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل الأسئلة السقراطية."},"useCases":{"en":["Clarifying ambiguous user requests","Conducting comprehensive content analysis","Unlocking hidden assumptions through systematic questioning"],"zh":["阐明模糊的用户请求","进行全面内容分析","通过系统性的提问解锁隐藏的假设"],"ja":["曖昧なユーザーのリクエストを明確にする","包括的なコンテンツ分析を実施する","体系的な質問を通じて隠れた仮定を解放する"],"ko":["모호한 사용자 요청澄清","포괄적인 내용 분석 수행","체계적인 질문을 통해 숨겨진 가정을 해방"],"es":["Clarificar solicitudes de usuario ambiguas","Realizar un análisis de contenido integral","Descubrir suposiciones ocultas a través de una interrogación sistemática"],"fr":["Clarifier les requêtes utilisateur ambiguës","Effectuer une analyse de contenu complète","Débloquer les hypothèses cachées grâce à une interrogation systématique"],"de":["Ambigue Benutzeranfragen klären","Eine umfassende Inhaltsanalyse durchführen","Versteckte Annahmen durch systematische Befragung aufdecken"],"pt":["Esclarecimento de solicitações de usuário ambíguas","Realização de análise de conteúdo abrangente","Desbloqueio de suposições ocultas por meio de questionamento sistemático"],"ru":["Уточнение неоднозначных запросов пользователей","Проведение всестороннего анализа контента","Раскрытие скрытых предположений посредством систематического вопроса"],"ar":["توضيح الطلبات الغامضة للمستخدم","إجراء تحليل شامل للمحتوى","فتح افتراضات خفية من خلال الأسئلة المنهجية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with natural language processing capabilities","May not be effective for extremely vague or open-ended requests"],"zh":["需要集成自然语言处理能力","可能不适用于极其模糊或开放式的请求"],"ja":["自然言語処理能力との統合が必要","極めて曖昧またはオープンエンドのリクエストには効果的ではない可能性がある"],"ko":["자연어 처리 능력과의 통합이 필요","극도로 모호하거나 개방형태의 요청에는 효과적이지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere integración con capacidades de procesamiento de lenguaje natural","Puede no ser efectivo para solicitudes extremadamente vagas o abiertas"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec des capacités de traitement du langage naturel","Peut ne pas être efficace pour des requêtes extrêmement vagues ou ouvertes"],"de":["Benötigt eine Integration mit Fähigkeiten zur Verarbeitung von natürlicher Sprache","Kann für extrem vage oder offene Anfragen nicht effektiv sein"],"pt":["Requer integração com capacidades de processamento de linguagem natural","Pode não ser eficaz para solicitações extremamente vagas ou abertas"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с возможностями обработки естественного языка","Может быть неэффективным для чрезвычайно неясных или открытых запросов"],"ar":["يتطلب التكامل مع قدرات معالجة اللغة الطبيعية","อาจ لا يكون فعالا للغاية对于 الطلبات الغامضة أو المفتوحة بشكل كبير"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"abb15a03ebf08bf7396f915177cf776dbc30f2ae17fdcbc4c7b396fbe6453572","qualityScore":39}');
