des intelligentes pour le développement assisté par IA","de":"Git Expert ist ein Skill, der eine Git-Arbeitsablaufverwaltung mit intelligenten Kommandovorschlägen für die AI-gestützte Entwicklung bietet","pt":"O que é Git Expert? É uma habilidade que fornece sugestões de comandos Git inteligentes para desenvolvedores.","ru":"Что такое Git Expert? Это навык, который предоставляет умные предложения команд Git для разработчиков.","ar":"ما هو خبير جيت؟ هو مهارة توفر اقتراحات أوامر جيت ذكية للطورين."},"features":{"en":["Smart command suggestions for git status via `/git:status`","Branch switching capabilities with `/git:switch`","New branch creation using `/git:create-branch`","Commit management with special instructions via `/git:commit`","Git history viewing with `/git:log`"],"zh":["智能Git命令建议","Git状态查询","分支切换","新分支创建","提交管理","代码拉取和推送"],"ja":["スマートなGitコマンドの提案","Git状態の照会","ブランチの切り替え","新しいブランチの作成","コミットの管理","コードのプルとプッシュ"],"ko":["智能적인 Git 명령어 제안","Git 상태 조회","브랜치 전환","새 브랜치 생성","커밋 관리","코드.Pull과.Push"],"es":["Sugerencias de comandos inteligentes para Git","Gestión de ramas con comandos como `/git:switch` y `/git:create-branch`","Commit y pull/push con comandos como `/git:commit` y `/git:pull`","Visualización del historial con `/git:log`","Integración con Claude Code para desarrollo asistido por AI"],"fr":["Suggestions de commandes intelligentes pour Git","Gestion de branches avec des commandes comme `/git:switch` et `/git:create-branch`","Commit et pull/push avec des commandes comme `/git:commit` et `/git:pull`","Visualisation de l''historique avec `/git:log`","Intégration avec Claude Code pour le développement assisté par IA"],"de":["Intelligente Kommandovorschläge für Git","Verwaltung von Branches mit Befehlen wie `/git:switch` und `/git:create-branch`","Commit und pull/push mit Befehlen wie `/git:commit` und `/git:pull`","Anzeige des Historie mit `/git:log`","Integration mit Claude Code für die AI-gestützte Entwicklung"],"pt":["Sugestões de comandos Git inteligentes","Gerenciamento de branches com `/git:switch`","Criação de branches novos com `/git:create-branch`","Commit com instruções especiais com `/git:commit`","Visualização do histórico com `/git:log`"],"ru":["Умные предложения команд Git","Управление ветками с помощью `/git:switch`","Создание новых веток с помощью `/git:create-branch`","Коммит с особыми инструкциями с помощью `/git:commit`","Просмотр истории с помощью `/git:log`"],"ar":["اقتراحات أوامر جيت ذكية","إدارة الفروع باستخدام `/git:switch`","إنشاء فروع جديدة باستخدام `/git:create-branch`","التعليق مع تعليمات خاصة باستخدام `/git:commit`","عرض السجل باستخدام `/git:log`"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use git-expert","git-expert setup guide","git-expert alternative","git-expert vs git tools","git-expert install","what is git-expert","git-expert for AI agents","git workflow management","Claude Code integration"],"zh":["Git Expert","AI智能Git","Git工作流管理","智能Git命令","Git状态查询","Git分支管理"],"ja":["Git Expert","AIエージェント","Gitワークフローの最適化","スマートなGitコマンド","Git状態の照会","Gitブランチの管理"],"ko":["Git Expert","AI 도구","Git 워크플로우 최적화","智能적인 Git 명령어","Git 상태 조회","Git 브랜치 관리"],"es":["git expert","desarrollo asistido por ai","gestión de tareas eficiente","sugerencias de comandos inteligentes","claude code","herramientas de desarrollo","ai para desarrolladores","git para principiantes","optimización de flujo de trabajo"],"fr":["git expert","développement assisté par ia","gestion de tâches efficace","suggestions de commandes intelligentes","claude code","outils de développement","ia pour les développeurs","git pour débutants","optimisation de flux de travail"],"de":["git expert","ai-gestützte entwicklung","effiziente aufgabenverwaltung","intelligente kommandovorschläge","claude code","entwicklungstools","ai für entwickler","git für anfänger","optimierung von arbeitsabläufen"],"pt":["git expert","desenvolvimento de software","gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho","sugestões de comandos Git"," Claude Code","desenvolvedores de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["git expert","разработка программного обеспечения","управление рабочим процессом","умные предложения команд Git","Claude Code","разработчики программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["خبير جيت","تطوير البرمجيات","إدارة تدفق العمل","اقتراحات أوامر جيت ذكية","كلود كود","مطورو البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"nathanvale","repo":"vtm-cli","repoPath":"nathanvale/vtm-cli","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.300Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"git-expert","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Git Expert Skill\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\nHelps you manage your git workflow with smart command suggestions.\n\n## Available Commands\n\n- `/git:status` - Get the current git status\n- `/git:switch` - Switch branches\n- `/git:create-branch` - Create a new branch\n- `/git:commit` - Make a commit with special instructions\n- `/git:pull` - Pull changes\n- `/git:push` - Push changes\n- `/git:log` - View history/what''s been done\n\n## When Claude Uses This\n\nWhen you mention things like:\n- \"what''s the git stat","body":"# Git Expert Skill\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\nHelps you manage your git workflow with smart command suggestions.\n\n## Available Commands\n\n- `/git:status` - Get the current git status\n- `/git:switch` - Switch branches\n- `/git:create-branch` - Create a new branch\n- `/git:commit` - Make a commit with special instructions\n- `/git:pull` - Pull changes\n- `/git:push` - Push changes\n- `/git:log` - View history/what''s been done\n\n## When Claude Uses This\n\nWhen you mention things like:\n- \"what''s the git status?\" → Suggests `/git:status`\n- \"I need to switch branches\" → Suggests `/git:switch`\n- \"create a new feature branch\" → Suggests `/git:create-branch`\n- \"let me commit my changes\" → Suggests `/git:commit`\n- \"pull the latest changes\" → Suggests `/git:pull`\n- \"push my commits\" → Suggests `/git:push`\n- \"show the commit history\" → Suggests `/git:log`\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Before starting**: Run `/git:status` to see current state\n2. **Understand scope**: Verify which branch you''re on\n3. **Track progress**: Review commit history with `/git:log`\n4. **Keep updated**: Pull changes before pushing\n\n## Customization\n\nEdit the trigger phrases in the frontmatter above to match your vocabulary.\nKeep the skill description updated as you evolve the domain.\n\n## Integration\n\nWorks seamlessly with other Claude Code domains:\n- Can be invoked manually: `/git:operation`\n- Auto-triggered by Claude based on conversation\n- Works with other skills and commands\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n**Start a feature:**\n```\n/git:status                    # Check current state\n/git:create-branch feature/x   # Create new branch\n```\n\n**Commit and push:**\n```\n/git:status                    # Review changes\n/git:commit \"message\"          # Create commit\n/git:push origin branch-name   # Push to remote\n```\n\n**Update your branch:**\n```\n/git:pull origin main          # Get latest main\n# Resolve conflicts if needed\n/git:push origin branch-name   # Push your work\n```\n\n**Review history:**\n```\n/git:log --oneline 10          # Recent commits\n/git:log --graph --oneline     # Branch structure\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:31.208Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined git workflow management with Claude Code","zh":"非常适合需要使用 Claude Code 进行流畅的 git 工作流管理的开发代理","ja":"Claude Code を使用したスムーズな git ワークフロー管理が必要な開発エージェントに最適","ko":"클로드 코드를 사용한 깔끔한 깃 워크플ロー 관리가 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan una gestión de flujo de trabajo de git optimizada con Claude Code","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une gestion de workflow git simplifiée avec Claude Code","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine optimierte Git-Workflow-Verwaltung mit Claude Code benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de gestão de fluxo de trabalho git simplificada com Claude Code","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходим упрощенный менеджер рабочих процессов git с Claude Code","ar":"مثالي لوسائل الإنماء التي تحتاج إلى إدارة تدفق العمل المبسطة مع Claude Code"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage git workflows efficiently with smart command suggestions, supporting commands like `/git:status`, `/git:switch`, and `/git:commit`, leveraging git protocols for seamless version control","zh":"赋予代理高效管理 git 工作流的能力，提供智能命令建议，支持诸如 `/git:status`、`/git:switch` 和 `/git:commit` 命令，利用 git 协议实现无缝版本控制","ja":"エージェントが git ワークフローを効率的に管理できるようにし、`/git:status`、`/git:switch`、`/git:commit` などのコマンドをサポートするスマートコマンドの提案を提供し、git プロトコルを使用してシームレスなバージョン管理を実現","ko":"에이전트가 깃 워크플ロー를 효율적으로 관리할 수 있도록 하며, `/git:status`, `/git:switch`, `/git:commit` 등의 명령어를 지원하는 스마트 명령어 제안을 제공하며, 깃 프로토콜을 사용하여 무결점 버전 관리를 구현","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar flujos de trabajo de git de forma eficiente con sugerencias de comandos inteligentes, admitiendo comandos como `/git:status`, `/git:switch` y `/git:commit`, aprovechando los protocolos de git para un control de versiones sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les flux de travail git de manière efficace avec des suggestions de commandes intelligentes, prenant en charge des commandes comme `/git:status`, `/git:switch` et `/git:commit`, en exploitant les protocoles git pour un contrôle de version sans accroc","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Git-Workflows effizient zu verwalten, mit intelligenten Befehlsvorschlägen, die Befehle wie `/git:status`, `/git:switch` und `/git:commit` unterstützen, wodurch Git-Protokolle für eine reibungslose Versionskontrolle genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar fluxos de trabalho git de forma eficiente com sugestões de comandos inteligentes, suportando comandos como `/git:status`, `/git:switch` e `/git:commit`, aproveitando protocolos git para controle de versão sem interrupções","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективного управления рабочими процессами git с помощью умных предложений команд, поддерживая команды типа `/git:status`, `/git:switch` и `/git:commit`, используя протоколы git для бесшовного контроля версий","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة تدفقات العمل git بفعالية مع اقتراحات أوامر ذكية،تدعم أوامر مثل `/git:status` و `/git:switch` و `/git:commit` ،وتستفيد من بروتوكولات git للتحكم في الإصدارات بدون انقطاع"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating branch switching with `/git:switch`","Generating commit messages with `/git:commit`","Debugging git workflows using `/git:log` and `/git:status`"],"zh":["使用 `/git:switch` 自动切换分支","使用 `/git:commit` 生成提交消息","使用 `/git:log` 和 `/git:status` 调试 git 工作流"],"ja":["`/git:switch` を使用してブランチを自動切換","`/git:commit` を使用してコミットメッセージを生成","`/git:log` と `/git:status` を使用して git ワークフローをデバッグ"],"ko":["`/git:switch`를 사용하여 브랜치를 자동 전환","`/git:commit`를 사용하여 커밋 메시지를 생성","`/git:log`와 `/git:status`를 사용하여 깃 워크플ロー 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización del cambio de rama con `/git:switch`","Generación de mensajes de confirmación con `/git:commit`","Depuración de flujos de trabajo de git utilizando `/git:log` y `/git:status`"],"fr":["Automatisation du commutation de branche avec `/git:switch`","Génération de messages de validation avec `/git:commit`","Débogage des flux de travail git en utilisant `/git:log` et `/git:status`"],"de":["Automatisierung des Branch-Wechsels mit `/git:switch`","Generierung von Commit-Nachrichten mit `/git:commit`","Fehlerbehebung von Git-Workflows unter Verwendung von `/git:log` und `/git:status`"],"pt":["Automatizar a troca de branches com `/git:switch`","Gerar mensagens de commit com `/git:commit`","Depurar fluxos de trabalho git usando `/git:log` e `/git:status`"],"ru":["Автоматизировать переключение веток с помощью `/git:switch`","Генерировать сообщения коммита с помощью `/git:commit`","Отладка рабочих процессов git с помощью `/git:log` и `/git:status`"],"ar":["تأتمتة تبديل الفروع مع `/git:switch`","توليد رسائل Commit مع `/git:commit`","تصحيح أخطاء تدفقات العمل git باستخدام `/git:log` و `/git:status`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code integration","Git workflow management only"],"zh":["需要 Claude Code 集成","仅限 git 工作流管理"],"ja":["Claude Code の統合が必要","git ワークフロー管理のみ"],"ko":["클라우드 코드 통합이 필요","깃 워크플ロー 관리만"],"es":["Requiere integración con Claude Code","Gestión de flujos de trabajo de git solo"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec Claude Code","Gestion de flux de travail git uniquement"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit Claude Code","Nur Git-Workflow-Verwaltung"],"pt":["Requer integração com Claude Code","Gestão de fluxo de trabalho git apenas"],"ru":["Требуется интеграция с Claude Code","Только управление рабочими процессами git"],"ar":["يتطلب تكامل مع Claude Code","إدارة تدفق العمل git فقط"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"d648d9625c6a89a1f5090f7c35d10b3bc7bcf398e3bc15c3cbbca336b47bee04","qualityScore":39}');
