lang-swift is an AI Agent skill designed for Swift 6.0+ development. It specializes in iOS and macOS projects, providing expert support for SwiftUI 6, the Combine framework, and Swift''s native concurrency model, including async/await and actors.","zh":"do-lang-swift 是一个 Swift 6+ 开发工具，提供自动触发和开发支持。","ja":"do-lang-swift は Swift 6+ 開発ツールで、自動トリガーと開発サポートを提供します。","ko":"do-lang-swift는 Swift 6+ 개발 도구로, 자동 트리거와 개발 지원을 제공합니다.","es":"do-lang-swift es un agente de desarrollo de Swift 6+ que permite crear aplicaciones iOS y macOS con tecnologías como SwiftUI y Combine","fr":"do-lang-swift est un agent de développement Swift 6+ qui permet de créer des applications iOS et macOS avec des technologies comme SwiftUI et Combine","de":"do-lang-swift ist ein Entwicklungstool für Swift 6+, das die Erstellung von iOS- und macOS-Apps mit Technologien wie SwiftUI und Combine ermöglicht","pt":"O do-lang-swift é um agente de desenvolvimento que oferece suporte a linguagem Swift 6+ para criar aplicativos iOS e macOS","ru":"ИИ Агент do-lang-swift - это агент разработки, который предлагает поддержку языка Swift 6+ для создания приложений iOS и macOS","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي do-lang-swift هي أداة برمجة توفر دعمًا للغة Swift 6+ لإنشاء تطبيقات iOS و macOS"},"features":{"en":["Expert support for Swift 6.0 features like typed throws and data-race safety","SwiftUI 6 development with the @Observable macro and NavigationStack","Reactive programming using the Combine framework with publishers and subscribers","Swift Concurrency implementation with async/await and actors","Auto-triggers on Swift files (.swift), iOS/macOS projects, and Xcode workspaces"],"zh":["支持 Swift 6.0 的Typed throws 和Concurrency","集成 SwiftUI 6 的 @Observable macro 和 NavigationStack","提供 Combine 的 Reactive programming","支持 Swift Concurrency 的 async/await 和 actors"],"ja":["Swift 6.0 の Typed throws と Concurrency をサポート","SwiftUI 6 の @Observable マクロと NavigationStack を統合","Combine の Reactive プログラミングを提供","Swift Concurrency の async/await と actors をサポート"],"ko":["Swift 6.0의 Typed throws와 Concurrency 지원","SwiftUI 6의 @Observable 매크로와 NavigationStack 통합","Combine의 Reactive 프로그래밍 제공","Swift Concurrency의 async/await와 actors 지원"],"es":["Desarrollo de aplicaciones iOS y macOS con Swift 6+","Integración con SwiftUI para interfaces de usuario modernas","Uso de Combine para programación reactiva","Soporte para Swift Concurrency con async/await y actores","Compatibilidad con Xcode workspaces y proyectos iOS/macOS","Auto-detección de archivos Swift y proyectos relacionados"],"fr":["Développement d''applications iOS et macOS avec Swift 6+","Intégration avec SwiftUI pour des interfaces utilisateur modernes","Utilisation de Combine pour la programmation réactive","Prise en charge de Swift Concurrency avec async/await et acteurs","Compatibilité avec les espaces de travail Xcode et les projets iOS/macOS","Détection automatique des fichiers Swift et des projets associés"],"de":["Entwicklung von iOS- und macOS-Apps mit Swift 6+","Integration mit SwiftUI für moderne Benutzeroberflächen","Verwendung von Combine für reaktive Programmierung","Unterstützung für Swift Concurrency mit async/await und Akteuren","Kompatibilität mit Xcode-Arbeitsbereichen und iOS/macOS-Projekten","Automatische Erkennung von Swift-Dateien und verwandten Projekten"],"pt":["Suporte a Swift 6.0 com typed throws e concorrência completa","Integração com SwiftUI 6 para interfaces de usuário declarativas","Uso de Combine para programação reativa","Suporte a Swift Concurrency com async/await e atores"],"ru":["Поддержка Swift 6.0 с типизированными исключениями и полной конкуренцией","Интеграция с SwiftUI 6 для декларативных пользовательских интерфейсов","Использование Combine для реактивного программирования","Поддержка Swift Concurrency с async/await и акторами"],"ar":["دعم لغة Swift 6.0 مع إلقاء أنواع وتنافس كاملة","التكامل مع SwiftUI 6 ل_interfaces المستخدم الإعلانية","استخدام Combine للبرمجة التفاعلية","دعم Swift Concurrency مع async/await و ممثلين"]},"keywords":{"en":["what is do-lang-swift","how to use do-lang-swift for SwiftUI","do-lang-swift vs other swift ai tools","do-lang-swift install guide","do-lang-swift setup for Xcode","do-lang-swift Swift Concurrency support","do-lang-swift Combine framework","do-lang-swift auto-trigger swift files"],"zh":["Swift 6+ 开发","SwiftUI","Combine","Swift Concurrency","iOS 开发","macOS 开发","Xcode","Swift 6.0","SwiftUI 6"],"ja":["Swift 6+ 開発","SwiftUI","Combine","Swift Concurrency","iOS 開発","macOS 開発","Xcode","Swift 6.0","SwiftUI 6","AIエージェント"],"ko":["Swift 6+ 개발","SwiftUI","Combine","Swift Concurrency","iOS 개발","macOS 개발","Xcode","Swift 6.0","SwiftUI 6","AI 도구"],"es":["do-lang-swift","desarrollo de iOS","Swift 6+","SwiftUI","Combine","Swift Concurrency","Xcode","iOS development","macOS development","agentes de desarrollo"],"fr":["do-lang-swift","développement iOS","Swift 6+","SwiftUI","Combine","Swift Concurrency","Xcode","développement iOS","développement macOS","agents de développement"],"de":["do-lang-swift","iOS-Entwicklung","Swift 6+","SwiftUI","Combine","Swift Concurrency","Xcode","iOS-Entwicklung","macOS-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["do-lang-swift","Swift 6+","iOS","macOS","SwiftUI","Combine","Swift Concurrency","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","programação reativa"],"ru":["ИИ Агент do-lang-swift","Swift 6+","iOS","macOS","SwiftUI","Combine","Swift Concurrency","разработка приложений","реактивное программирование"],"ar":["أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي do-lang-swift","Swift 6+","iOS","macOS","SwiftUI","Combine","Swift Concurrency","برمجة تطبيقات","برمجة تفاعلية"]}},"owner":"yejune","repo":"do-focus","repoPath":"yejune/do-focus","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.301Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"do-lang-swift","description":">","version":"2.1.0","tags":"swift, swiftui, ios, macos, combine, concurrency","bodyPreview":"# Swift 6+ Development Specialist\n\nSwift 6.0+ development expert for iOS/macOS with SwiftUI, Combine, and Swift Concurrency.\n\nAuto-Triggers: Swift files (`.swift`), iOS/macOS projects, Xcode workspaces\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Core Capabilities\n\n- Swift 6.0: Typed throws, complete concurrency, data-race safety by default\n- SwiftUI 6: @Observable macro, NavigationStack, modern declarative UI\n- Combine: Reactive programming with publishers and subscribers\n- Swift Concurrency: async/await, actors,","body":"# Swift 6+ Development Specialist\n\nSwift 6.0+ development expert for iOS/macOS with SwiftUI, Combine, and Swift Concurrency.\n\nAuto-Triggers: Swift files (`.swift`), iOS/macOS projects, Xcode workspaces\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Core Capabilities\n\n- Swift 6.0: Typed throws, complete concurrency, data-race safety by default\n- SwiftUI 6: @Observable macro, NavigationStack, modern declarative UI\n- Combine: Reactive programming with publishers and subscribers\n- Swift Concurrency: async/await, actors, TaskGroup, isolation\n- XCTest: Unit testing, UI testing, async test support\n- Swift Package Manager: Dependency management\n\n### Version Requirements\n\n- Swift: 6.0+\n- Xcode: 16.0+\n- iOS: 17.0+ (recommended), minimum 15.0\n- macOS: 14.0+ (recommended)\n\n### Project Setup\n\nPackage.swift Configuration: Begin with swift-tools-version comment set to 6.0. Import PackageDescription. Define let package with Package initializer. Set name, platforms array with .iOS and .macOS minimum versions, products array with library definitions, dependencies array with package URLs and version requirements, and targets array with target and testTarget entries including dependencies.\n\n### Essential Patterns\n\nBasic @Observable ViewModel: Import Observation framework. Apply @Observable and @MainActor attributes to final class. Declare private(set) var properties for state. Create async functions that set isLoading true, use defer to set false, and assign fetched data with try? await and nil coalescing.\n\nBasic SwiftUI View: Define struct conforming to View. Declare @State private var for viewModel. In body computed property, use NavigationStack containing List iterating over viewModel items. Add .task modifier calling await on viewModel.load and .refreshable modifier for pull-to-refresh.\n\nBasic Actor for Thread Safety: Define actor type with private dictionary for cache. Create get function returning optional Data for key lookup. Create set function taking key and data parameters for cache storage.\n\n## Module Index\n\n### Swift 6 Features\n\n[modules/swift6-features.md](modules/swift6-features.md)\n\n- Typed throws for precise error handling\n- Complete concurrency checking\n- Data-race safety by default\n- Sendable conformance requirements\n\n### SwiftUI Patterns\n\n[modules/swiftui-patterns.md](modules/swiftui-patterns.md)\n\n- @Observable macro and state management\n- NavigationStack and navigation patterns\n- View lifecycle and .task modifier\n- Environment and dependency injection\n\n### Swift Concurrency\n\n[modules/concurrency.md](modules/concurrency.md)\n\n- async/await fundamentals\n- Actor isolation and @MainActor\n- TaskGroup for parallel execution\n- Custom executors and structured concurrency\n\n### Combine Framework\n\n[modules/combine-reactive.md](modules/combine-reactive.md)\n\n- Publishers and Subscribers\n- Operators and transformations\n- async/await bridge patterns\n- Integration with SwiftUI\n\n## Context7 Library Mappings\n\n### Core Swift\n\n- `/apple/swift` - Swift language and standard library\n- `/apple/swift-evolution` - Swift evolution proposals\n- `/apple/swift-package-manager` - SwiftPM documentation\n- `/apple/swift-async-algorithms` - Async sequence algorithms\n\n### Popular Libraries\n\n- `/Alamofire/Alamofire` - HTTP networking\n- `/onevcat/Kingfisher` - Image downloading and caching\n- `/realm/realm-swift` - Mobile database\n- `/pointfreeco/swift-composable-architecture` - TCA architecture\n- `/Quick/Quick` - BDD testing framework\n- `/Quick/Nimble` - Matcher framework\n\n## Testing Quick Start\n\nAsync Test with MainActor: Apply @MainActor attribute to test class extending XCTestCase. Define test function with async throws. Create mock API and set mock data. Initialize system under test with mock. Call await on async method. Use XCTAssertEqual for count verification and XCTAssertFalse for boolean state checks.\n\n## Works Well With\n\n- `do-lang-kotlin` - Android counterpart for cross-platform projects\n- `do-lang-flutter` - Flutter/Dart for cross-platform mobile\n- `do-domain-backend` - API integration and backend communication\n- `do-foundation-quality` - iOS security best practices\n- `do-workflow-testing` - Xcode debugging and profiling\n\n## Resources\n\n- [reference.md](reference.md) - Architecture patterns, network layer, SwiftData\n- [examples.md](examples.md) - Production-ready code examples\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:37.581Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for iOS and macOS Development Agents seeking expertise in Swift 6.0+ development with modern SwiftUI, Combine, and Swift Concurrency features.","zh":"适合寻求Swift 6.0+开发专业知识的iOS和macOS开发代理，尤其是现代SwiftUI、Combine和Swift Concurrency功能。","ja":"Swift 6.0+開発の専門知識を求めるiOSとmacOS開発エージェントに適しています。特に、モダンなSwiftUI、Combine、Swift Concurrency機能。","ko":"Swift 6.0+ 개발 전문 지식을 찾는 iOS 및 macOS 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 특히 현대적인 SwiftUI, Combine 및 Swift Concurrency 기능입니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo de iOS y macOS que buscan experiencia en desarrollo con Swift 6.0+ y características modernas de SwiftUI, Combine y Swift Concurrency.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Développement d''iOS et de macOS recherchant une expertise dans le développement Swift 6.0+ avec les fonctionnalités modernes de SwiftUI, Combine et Swift Concurrency.","de":"Ideal für iOS- und macOS-Entwicklungsagenten, die Expertenwissen in der Entwicklung mit Swift 6.0+ und modernen Funktionen von SwiftUI, Combine und Swift Concurrency suchen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento do iOS e macOS que buscam especialização em desenvolvimento Swift 6.0+ com recursos modernos do SwiftUI, Combine e Swift Concurrency.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по разработке iOS и macOS, которые стремятся получить опыт в разработке на Swift 6.0+ с современными функциями SwiftUI, Combine и Swift Concurrency.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير iOS و macOS الذين يبحثون عن الخبرة في تطوير Swift 6.0+ مع ميزات SwiftUI و Combine و Swift Concurrency الحديثة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop scalable and concurrent iOS and macOS applications using Swift 6.0+ features like typed throws, complete concurrency, and data-race safety by default, along with SwiftUI''s @Observable macro, NavigationStack, and Combine''s reactive programming with publishers and subscribers.","zh":"赋予代理开发可扩展和并发的iOS和macOS应用程序的能力，使用Swift 6.0+的功能，如类型化抛出、完全并发和数据竞争安全，默认情况下启用，另外还有SwiftUI的@Observable宏、NavigationStack和Combine的响应式编程，具有发布者和订阅者。","ja":"エージェントがSwift 6.0+の機能を使用して、スケーラブルでコンカレントなiOSとmacOSアプリケーションを開発できるようにします。機能には、型付けされたスロー、完全なコンカレンシー、データレースの安全性が含まれます。デフォルトでは有効です。また、SwiftUIの@Observableマクロ、NavigationStack、Combineのパブリッシャーとサブスクライバーを使用したリアクティブプログラミングも含まれます。","ko":"에이전트가 Swift 6.0+ 기능을 사용하여 확장 가능하고 동시성 있는 iOS 및 macOS 응용 프로그램을 개발할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 기능에는 유형화 된 throw, 완전한 동시성 및 데이터 레이스 안전이 포함됩니다. 기본적으로 활성화됩니다. 또한 SwiftUI의 @Observable 매크로, NavigationStack 및 Combine의 출판자 및 구독자를 사용한 반응형 프로그래밍도 포함됩니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes desarrollar aplicaciones iOS y macOS escalables y concurrentes utilizando características de Swift 6.0+ como typed throws, concurrencia completa y seguridad contra carreras de datos por defecto, junto con la macro @Observable de SwiftUI, NavigationStack y la programación reactiva de Combine con publicadores y suscriptores.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des applications iOS et macOS escalables et concurrentes en utilisant les fonctionnalités de Swift 6.0+ telles que les typed throws, la concurrence complète et la sécurité contre les courses de données par défaut, ainsi que la macro @Observable de SwiftUI, NavigationStack et la programmation réactive de Combine avec des éditeurs et des abonnés.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, skalierbare und konkurrierende iOS- und macOS-Anwendungen mit Swift 6.0+-Funktionen wie typed throws, vollständiger Konkurrenz und Datenschutz gegen Datenrennen standardmäßig zu entwickeln, zusammen mit der @Observable-Macro von SwiftUI, NavigationStack und der reaktiven Programmierung von Combine mit Verlegern und Abonnenten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver aplicações iOS e macOS escaláveis e concorrentes usando recursos do Swift 6.0+, como throws tipados, concorrência completa e segurança contra corridas de dados por padrão, juntamente com a macro @Observable do SwiftUI, NavigationStack e programação reativa do Combine com publicadores e assinantes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разрабатывать масштабируемые и параллельные приложения iOS и macOS, используя функции Swift 6.0+, такие как типизированные броски, полная параллельность и безопасность от гонок данных по умолчанию, а также макрос @Observable из SwiftUI, NavigationStack и реактивное программирование из Combine с издателями и подписчиками.","ar":"يمنح العملاء القدرة على تطوير تطبيقات iOS و macOS قابلة للتوسيع ومتزامنة باستخدام ميزات Swift 6.0+ مثل throws المكتوبة و التزامن الكامل و أمان سباق البيانات افتراضيًا، إلى جانب وظيفة @Observable من SwiftUI و NavigationStack و البرمجة التفاعلية من Combine مع الناشرين والمشتركين."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing modern declarative UIs with SwiftUI 6","Implementing reactive programming patterns with Combine","Debugging concurrency issues with Swift Concurrency''s async/await and actors"],"zh":["使用SwiftUI 6开发现代的声明式UI","使用Combine实现响应式编程模式","使用Swift Concurrency的async/await和actors调试并发问题"],"ja":["SwiftUI 6を使用してモダンな宣言的UIを開発する","Combineを使用してリアクティブプログラミングパターンを実装する","Swift Concurrencyのasync/awaitとアクタを使用してコンカレンシーの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["SwiftUI 6를 사용하여 현대적인 선언적 UI를 개발하는 것","Combine을 사용하여 반응형 프로그래밍 패턴을 구현하는 것","Swift Concurrency의 async/await 및 액터를 사용하여 동시성 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Desarrollar interfaces de usuario declarativas modernas con SwiftUI 6","Implementar patrones de programación reactiva con Combine","Depurar problemas de concurrencia con async/await y actores de Swift Concurrency"],"fr":["Développer des interfaces utilisateur déclaratives modernes avec SwiftUI 6","Mettre en œuvre des modèles de programmation réactive avec Combine","Déboguer les problèmes de concurrence avec async/await et les acteurs de Swift Concurrency"],"de":["Entwickeln moderner deklarativer Benutzeroberflächen mit SwiftUI 6","Implementieren reaktiver Programmiermuster mit Combine","Fehlerbehebung von Konkurrenzproblemen mit async/await und Akteuren von Swift Concurrency"],"pt":["Desenvolver interfaces de usuário declarativas modernas com SwiftUI 6","Implementar padrões de programação reativa com Combine","Depurar problemas de concorrência com async/await e atores do Swift Concurrency"],"ru":["Разрабатывать современные декларативные интерфейсы пользователя с помощью SwiftUI 6","Реализовывать реактивные шаблоны программирования с помощью Combine","Отладить проблемы параллельности с помощью async/await и актеров Swift Concurrency"],"ar":["تطوير واجهات مستخدم إعلانية حديثة مع SwiftUI 6","تنفيذ أنماط برمجة تفاعلية مع Combine","تصحيح أخطاء التزامن باستخدام async/await و ممثلي Swift Concurrency"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Xcode workspaces or projects","Swift 6.0+ only","Limited to iOS and macOS development"],"zh":["需要Xcode工作区或项目","仅限Swift 6.0+","仅限iOS和macOS开发"],"ja":["Xcodeのワークスペースまたはプロジェクトが必要","Swift 6.0+のみ","iOSとmacOS開発のみ"],"ko":["Xcode 작업 공간 또는 프로젝트가 필요합니다","Swift 6.0+만 해당됩니다","iOS 및 macOS 개발만 해당됩니다"],"es":["Requiere espacios de trabajo o proyectos de Xcode","Solo Swift 6.0+","Limitado al desarrollo de iOS y macOS"],"fr":["Nécessite des espaces de travail ou des projets Xcode","Swift 6.0+ uniquement","Limité au développement d''iOS et de macOS"],"de":["Benötigt Xcode-Arbeitsbereiche oder -Projekte","Nur Swift 6.0+","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von iOS und macOS"],"pt":["Requer espaços de trabalho ou projetos do Xcode","Apenas Swift 6.0+","Limitado ao desenvolvimento do iOS e macOS"],"ru":["Требует рабочих пространств или проектов Xcode","Только Swift 6.0+","Ограничен разработкой для iOS и macOS"],"ar":["يتطلب مساحات عمل أو مشاريع Xcode","Swift 6.0+ فقط","محدود بتطوير iOS و macOS"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"e62de8b38ac6a5ec78a5d4a4cfb07da0bc622ed8447ebaeb897797cfb61d84e4","qualityScore":39}');
