epurar código fuente","fr":"llvm-tooling est un outil de développement qui utilise l''infrastructure de LLVM/Clang pour analyser et déboguer le code source","de":"llvm-tooling ist ein Entwicklungstool, das die Infrastruktur von LLVM/Clang zur Analyse und Fehlersuche von Quellcode verwendet","pt":"O que é llvm-tooling? É uma ferramenta de análise de código e depuração baseada em LLVM","ru":"Что такое llvm-tooling? Это инструмент анализа кода и отладки на основе LLVM","ar":"ما هو llvm-tooling؟ هو أداة تحليل وتصحيح الأخطاء مبنية على LLVM"},"features":{"en":["Develops Clang plugins as dynamically loaded libraries to extend Clang''s functionality during compilation","Utilizes the RecursiveASTVisitor class for source code analysis","Includes the clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry.h header file for plugin registration","Leverages the clang/AST/ASTConsumer.h header file for AST consumption","Supports integration with MSVC 2022 features"],"zh":["Clang插件开发","源代码分析","调试","IDE集成","使用RecursiveASTVisitor进行AST遍历"],"ja":["Clangプラグインの開発","ソースコード分析","デバッグ","IDE統合","RecursiveASTVisitorを使用したASTの遍历"],"ko":["Clang 플러그인 개발","소스 코드 분석","디버깅","IDE 통합","RecursiveASTVisitor를 사용한 AST 트리遍历"],"es":["Compatibilidad con MSVC 2022","Desarrollo de plugins de Clang","Análisis de código fuente con Clang","Depuración de código fuente con LLVM","Integración con IDE"],"fr":["Compatibilité avec MSVC 2022","Développement de plugins Clang","Analyse de code source avec Clang","Débogage de code source avec LLVM","Intégration avec les IDE"],"de":["Kompatibilität mit MSVC 2022","Entwicklung von Clang-Plugins","Quellcode-Analyse mit Clang","Fehlersuche von Quellcode mit LLVM","Integration mit IDE"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de plugins para Clang","Análise de código com suporte a MSVC 2022","Depuração e integração com IDEs","Compatibilidade explícita com recursos do MSVC 2022","Utilização de bibliotecas como clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry.h"],"ru":["Разработка плагинов для Clang","Анализ кода с поддержкой MSVC 2022","Отладка и интеграция с IDE","Явная совместимость с функциями MSVC 2022","Использование библиотек như clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry.h"],"ar":["تصميم ملحقات لclang","تحليل الكود مع دعم MSVC 2022","تصحيح الأخطاء وتكامل مع بيئات التطوير","توافق صريح مع ميزات MSVC 2022","استخدام مكتبات مثل clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry.h"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use llvm-tooling","llvm-tooling vs clang","llvm-tooling install guide","what is llvm-tooling","clang plugin development tutorial","llvm-tooling alternative to gcc"],"zh":["LLVM工具开发","Clang插件","源代码分析","调试","IDE集成","RecursiveASTVisitor","LLVM/Clang基础设施"],"ja":["LLVM Tooling","Clangプラグイン","ソースコード分析","デバッグ","IDE統合","RecursiveASTVisitor","LLVM/Clangインフラストラクチャ"],"ko":["LLVM 툴링","Clang 플러그인","소스 코드 분석","디버깅","IDE 통합","RecursiveASTVisitor","LLVM/Clang 인프라"],"es":["llvm-tooling","MSVC 2022","Clang","análisis de código fuente","desarrollo de plugins","depuración de código","integración con IDE","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["llvm-tooling","MSVC 2022","Clang","analyse de code source","développement de plugins","débogage de code","intégration avec les IDE","outils de développement"],"de":["llvm-tooling","MSVC 2022","Clang","Quellcode-Analyse","Entwicklung von Plugins","Fehlersuche von Quellcode","Integration mit IDE","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["llvm-tooling","desenvolvimento de ferramentas","análise de código","depuração","MSVC 2022","Clang","plugins","IDE","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["llvm-tooling","разработка инструментов","анализ кода","отладка","MSVC 2022","Clang","плагины","IDE","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["llvm-tooling","تصميم أدوات","تحليل الكود","تصحيح الأخطاء","MSVC 2022","clang","ملحقات","بيئة التطوير","تصميم البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"backengineering","repo":"llvm-msvc","repoPath":"backengineering/llvm-msvc","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.324Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"llvm-tooling","description":"Expertise in LLVM tooling development including Clang plugins, LLDB debugger extensions, Clangd/LSP, and LibTooling. Use this skill when building source code analysis tools, refactoring tools, debugger extensions, or IDE integrations.","bodyPreview":"# LLVM Tooling Skill\n\nThis skill covers development of tools using LLVM/Clang infrastructure for source code analysis, debugging, and IDE integration.\n\n## Clang Plugin Development\n\n### Plugin Architecture\nClang plugins are dynamically loaded libraries that extend Clang''s functionality during compilation.\n\n```cpp\n#include \"clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry.h\"\n#include \"clang/AST/ASTConsumer.h\"\n#include \"clang/AST/RecursiveASTVisitor.h\"\n\nclass MyVisitor : public clang::RecursiveASTVisitor<MyVi","body":"# LLVM Tooling Skill\n\nThis skill covers development of tools using LLVM/Clang infrastructure for source code analysis, debugging, and IDE integration.\n\n## Clang Plugin Development\n\n### Plugin Architecture\nClang plugins are dynamically loaded libraries that extend Clang''s functionality during compilation.\n\n```cpp\n#include \"clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry.h\"\n#include \"clang/AST/ASTConsumer.h\"\n#include \"clang/AST/RecursiveASTVisitor.h\"\n\nclass MyVisitor : public clang::RecursiveASTVisitor<MyVisitor> {\npublic:\n    bool VisitFunctionDecl(clang::FunctionDecl *FD) {\n        llvm::outs() << \"Found function: \" << FD->getName() << \"\\n\";\n        return true;\n    }\n};\n\nclass MyConsumer : public clang::ASTConsumer {\n    MyVisitor Visitor;\npublic:\n    void HandleTranslationUnit(clang::ASTContext &Context) override {\n        Visitor.TraverseDecl(Context.getTranslationUnitDecl());\n    }\n};\n\nclass MyPlugin : public clang::PluginASTAction {\nprotected:\n    std::unique_ptr<clang::ASTConsumer> CreateASTConsumer(\n        clang::CompilerInstance &CI, llvm::StringRef) override {\n        return std::make_unique<MyConsumer>();\n    }\n    \n    bool ParseArgs(const clang::CompilerInstance &CI,\n                   const std::vector<std::string> &args) override {\n        return true;\n    }\n};\n\nstatic clang::FrontendPluginRegistry::Add<MyPlugin>\n    X(\"my-plugin\", \"My custom plugin description\");\n```\n\n### Running Clang Plugins\n```bash\n# Build plugin\nclang++ -shared -fPIC -o MyPlugin.so MyPlugin.cpp \\\n    $(llvm-config --cxxflags --ldflags)\n\n# Run plugin\nclang -Xclang -load -Xclang ./MyPlugin.so \\\n      -Xclang -plugin -Xclang my-plugin \\\n      source.cpp\n```\n\n## LibTooling\n\n### Standalone Tools\n```cpp\n#include \"clang/Tooling/CommonOptionsParser.h\"\n#include \"clang/Tooling/Tooling.h\"\n#include \"clang/ASTMatchers/ASTMatchFinder.h\"\n\nusing namespace clang::tooling;\nusing namespace clang::ast_matchers;\n\n// Define matcher\nauto functionMatcher = functionDecl(hasName(\"targetFunction\")).bind(\"func\");\n\n// Callback handler\nclass FunctionCallback : public MatchFinder::MatchCallback {\npublic:\n    void run(const MatchFinder::MatchResult &Result) override {\n        if (auto *FD = Result.Nodes.getNodeAs<FunctionDecl>(\"func\")) {\n            llvm::outs() << \"Found: \" << FD->getQualifiedNameAsString() << \"\\n\";\n        }\n    }\n};\n\nint main(int argc, const char **argv) {\n    auto ExpectedParser = CommonOptionsParser::create(argc, argv, MyCategory);\n    ClangTool Tool(ExpectedParser->getCompilations(),\n                   ExpectedParser->getSourcePathList());\n    \n    FunctionCallback Callback;\n    MatchFinder Finder;\n    Finder.addMatcher(functionMatcher, &Callback);\n    \n    return Tool.run(newFrontendActionFactory(&Finder).get());\n}\n```\n\n### AST Matchers Reference\n```cpp\n// Declaration matchers\nfunctionDecl()           // Match function declarations\nvarDecl()               // Match variable declarations\nrecordDecl()            // Match struct/class/union\nfieldDecl()             // Match class fields\ncxxMethodDecl()         // Match C++ methods\ncxxConstructorDecl()    // Match constructors\n\n// Expression matchers\ncallExpr()              // Match function calls\nbinaryOperator()        // Match binary operators\nunaryOperator()         // Match unary operators\nmemberExpr()            // Match member access\n\n// Narrowing matchers\nhasName(\"name\")         // Filter by name\nhasType(asString(\"int\")) // Filter by type\nisPublic()              // Filter by access specifier\nhasAnyParameter(...)    // Match parameters\n\n// Traversal matchers\nhasDescendant(...)      // Match anywhere in subtree\nhasAncestor(...)        // Match in parent chain\nhas(...)                // Match direct children\nforEach(...)            // Match all children\n```\n\n## LLDB Extension Development\n\n### Python Commands\n```python\nimport lldb\n\ndef my_command(debugger, command, result, internal_dict):\n    \"\"\"Custom LLDB command implementation\"\"\"\n    target = debugger.GetSelectedTarget()\n    process = target.GetProcess()\n    thread = process.GetSelectedThread()\n    frame = thread.GetSelectedFrame()\n    \n    # Get variable value\n    var = frame.FindVariable(\"my_var\")\n    result.AppendMessage(f\"my_var = {var.GetValue()}\")\n\ndef __lldb_init_module(debugger, internal_dict):\n    debugger.HandleCommand(\n        ''command script add -f my_module.my_command my_cmd'')\n```\n\n### Scripted Process\n```python\nclass MyScriptedProcess(lldb.SBScriptedProcess):\n    def __init__(self, target, args):\n        super().__init__(target, args)\n        \n    def get_thread_with_id(self, tid):\n        # Return thread info\n        pass\n    \n    def get_registers_for_thread(self, tid):\n        # Return register context\n        pass\n    \n    def read_memory_at_address(self, addr, size):\n        # Read memory\n        pass\n```\n\n### LLDB GUI Extensions\n- **visual-lldb**: GUI frontend for LLDB\n- **vegvisir**: Browser-based LLDB GUI\n- **lldbg**: Lightweight native GUI\n- **CodeLLDB**: VSCode debugger extension\n\n## Clangd / Language Server Protocol\n\n### Custom LSP Extensions\n```cpp\n// Implementing custom code actions\nclass MyCodeActionProvider {\npublic:\n    std::vector<CodeAction> getCodeActions(\n        const TextDocumentIdentifier &File,\n        const Range &Range,\n        const CodeActionContext &Context) {\n        \n        std::vector<CodeAction> Actions;\n        \n        // Add custom refactoring action\n        CodeAction Action;\n        Action.title = \"Extract to function\";\n        Action.kind = \"refactor.extract\";\n        \n        // Define workspace edits\n        WorkspaceEdit Edit;\n        // ... populate edits\n        Action.edit = Edit;\n        \n        Actions.push_back(Action);\n        return Actions;\n    }\n};\n```\n\n### Clangd Configuration\n```yaml\n# .clangd configuration file\nCompileFlags:\n  Add: [-xc++, -std=c++17]\n  Remove: [-W*]\n\nDiagnostics:\n  ClangTidy:\n    Add: [modernize-*, performance-*]\n    Remove: [modernize-use-trailing-return-type]\n\nIndex:\n  Background: Build\n```\n\n## Source-to-Source Transformation\n\n### Clang Rewriter\n```cpp\n#include \"clang/Rewrite/Core/Rewriter.h\"\n\nclass MyRewriter : public RecursiveASTVisitor<MyRewriter> {\n    Rewriter &R;\n    \npublic:\n    MyRewriter(Rewriter &R) : R(R) {}\n    \n    bool VisitFunctionDecl(FunctionDecl *FD) {\n        // Add comment before function\n        R.InsertTextBefore(FD->getBeginLoc(), \"// Auto-generated\\n\");\n        \n        // Replace function name\n        R.ReplaceText(FD->getLocation(), \n                      FD->getName().size(), \"new_name\");\n        \n        return true;\n    }\n};\n```\n\n### RefactoringTool\n```cpp\n#include \"clang/Tooling/Refactoring.h\"\n\nclass MyRefactoring : public RefactoringCallback {\npublic:\n    void run(const MatchFinder::MatchResult &Result) override {\n        // Generate replacements\n        Replacement Rep(\n            *Result.SourceManager,\n            CharSourceRange::getTokenRange(Range),\n            \"new_text\");\n        \n        Replacements.insert(Rep);\n    }\n};\n```\n\n## Notable Tools Built with LLVM Tooling\n\n### Analysis Tools\n- **cppinsights**: C++ template instantiation visualization\n- **ClangBuildAnalyzer**: Build time analysis\n- **clazy**: Qt-specific static analysis\n\n### Refactoring Tools\n- **clang-rename**: Symbol renaming\n- **clang-tidy**: Linting and auto-fixes\n- **include-what-you-use**: Include optimization\n\n### Code Generation\n- **classgen**: Extract type info for IDA\n- **constexpr-everything**: Auto-apply constexpr\n- **clang-expand**: Inline function expansion\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use AST Matchers**: More readable than manual traversal\n2. **Preserve Formatting**: Use Rewriter carefully to maintain style\n3. **Handle Macros**: Be aware of macro expansion locations\n4. **Test Thoroughly**: Edge cases in C++ are numerous\n5. **Provide Good Diagnostics**: Clear error messages improve usability\n\n## Resources\n\nSee Clang Plugins, Clangd/Language Server, and LLDB sections in README.md for comprehensive tool listings.\n\n## Getting Detailed Information\n\nWhen you need detailed and up-to-date resource links, tool lists, or project references, fetch the latest data from:\n\n```\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/gmh5225/awesome-llvm-security/refs/heads/main/README.md\n```\n\nThis README contains comprehensive curated lists of:\n- Clang plugins and extensions (Clang Plugins section)\n- Language server implementations (Clangd/Language Server section)\n- LLDB debugger tools and GUIs (LLDB section)\n- Static analysis and refactoring tools\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:00.247Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Compiler Agents requiring advanced source code analysis and debugging capabilities through LLVM/Clang infrastructure.","zh":"适用于需要通过LLVM/Clang基础设施进行高级源代码分析和调试的编译器代理。","ja":"LLVM/Clangインフラストラクチャを介した高度なソースコード分析およびデバッグ機能を必要とするコンパイラエージェントに適しています。","ko":"LLVM/Clang 인프라를 통해 고급 소스 코드 분석 및 디버깅 기능을 필요로 하는 컴파일러 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Compiladores que requieren un análisis y depuración de código fuente avanzados a través de la infraestructura LLVM/Clang.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de compilation nécessitant une analyse et un débogage de code source avancés via l''infrastructure LLVM/Clang.","de":"Ideal für Compiler-Agents, die eine erweiterte Analyse und Fehlersuche von Quellcode durch die LLVM/Clang-Infrastruktur erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Compiladores que exigem análise avançada de código-fonte e capacidades de depuração por meio da infraestrutura LLVM/Clang.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов компиляторов, требующих расширенного анализа исходного кода и возможностей отладки через инфраструктуру LLVM/Clang.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المجمع الذي يتطلب تحليل شفرة مصدر متقدم وقدرات فحص عبر بنية تحتية LLVM/Clang."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop custom tools using Clang plugins, leveraging libraries like clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry and clang/AST/ASTConsumer for comprehensive code inspection and IDE integration, facilitating enhanced debugging and optimization protocols.","zh":"赋予代理开发使用Clang插件的自定义工具的能力，利用如clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry和clang/AST/ASTConsumer的库，进行全面代码检查和IDE集成，从而实现增强的调试和优化协议。","ja":"エージェントがClangプラグインを使用したカスタムツールを開発できるようにし、clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistryやclang/AST/ASTConsumerなどのライブラリを利用して、包括的なコードの検査とIDEの統合を行い、強化されたデバッグと最適化プロトコルを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 Clang 플러그인을 사용하여 사용자 정의 도구를 개발할 수 있도록 하며, clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry 및 clang/AST/ASTConsumer와 같은 라이브러리를 활용하여 toàn面的 코드 검사 및 IDE 통합을 수행하여 강화된 디버깅 및 최적화 프로토콜을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar herramientas personalizadas utilizando plugins de Clang, aprovechando bibliotecas como clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry y clang/AST/ASTConsumer para una inspección y integración de IDE comprehensiva, facilitando protocolos de depuración y optimización mejorados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des outils personnalisés en utilisant des plugins Clang, en exploitant des bibliothèques telles que clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry et clang/AST/ASTConsumer pour une inspection et une intégration de l''IDE complètes, facilitant des protocoles de débogage et d''optimisation améliorés.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, benutzerdefinierte Tools mit Hilfe von Clang-Plugins zu entwickeln, indem Bibliotheken wie clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry und clang/AST/ASTConsumer für eine umfassende Code-Inspektion und IDE-Integration genutzt werden, wodurch verbesserte Fehlersuche- und Optimierungsprotokolle erleichtert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver ferramentas personalizadas usando plugins do Clang, aproveitando bibliotecas como clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry e clang/AST/ASTConsumer para inspeção de código abrangente e integração com IDE, facilitando protocolos de depuração e otimização aprimorados.","ru":"Позволяет агентам разрабатывать пользовательские инструменты с помощью плагинов Clang, используя такие библиотеки, как clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry и clang/AST/ASTConsumer для всестороннего осмотра кода и интеграции с IDE, облегчая улучшенные протоколы отладки и оптимизации.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتطوير أدوات مخصصة باستخدام ملحقات Clang، واستخدام المكتبات مثل clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry و clang/AST/ASTConsumer لفحص شفرة شامل وتكامل مع بيئة التطوير المتكاملة، وتسهيل بروتوكولات فحص وتنقيح محسّنة."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing Clang plugins for static code analysis","Creating custom AST visitors for code traversal and inspection","Integrating LLVM tools with IDEs for seamless development workflows"],"zh":["为静态代码分析开发Clang插件","创建自定义AST访问器用于代码遍历和检查","将LLVM工具与IDE集成以实现无缝的开发工作流"],"ja":["静的コード分析のためのClangプラグインの開発","コードのトラバースと検査のためのカスタムASTビジターの作成","LLVMツールとIDEの統合によるシームレスな開発ワークフロー"],"ko":["정적 코드 분석을 위한 Clang 플러그인 개발","코드 트래버스 및 검사용 사용자 정의 AST 방문자의 생성","IDE와의 LLVM 툴 통합을 통한 無縫な 개발 워크플로"],"es":["Desarrollar plugins de Clang para análisis de código estático","Crear visitantes personalizados de AST para la inspección y el recorrido de código","Integrar herramientas de LLVM con IDE para flujos de trabajo de desarrollo sin problemas"],"fr":["Développer des plugins Clang pour l''analyse de code statique","Créer des visiteurs AST personnalisés pour l''inspection et la traversée de code","Intégrer les outils LLVM avec les IDE pour des flux de travail de développement sans interruption"],"de":["Entwicklung von Clang-Plugins für die statische Code-Analyse","Erstellung benutzerdefinierter AST-Visitor für die Code-Inspektion und -Durchquerung","Integration von LLVM-Tools mit IDE für nahtlose Entwicklungsworkflows"],"pt":["Desenvolver plugins do Clang para análise de código estático","Criar visitantes AST personalizados para travessia e inspeção de código","Integrar ferramentas do LLVM com IDEs para fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento sem interrupções"],"ru":["Разработка плагинов Clang для статического анализа кода","Создание пользовательских посетителей AST для обхода и осмотра кода","Интеграция инструментов LLVM с IDE для бесперебойных рабочих процессов разработки"],"ar":["تطوير ملحقات Clang لتحليل الشفرة الساكنة","إنشاء زوار AST مخصصون لعبور وفحص الشفرة","دمج أدوات LLVM مع بيئات التطوير المتكاملة من أجل سير عمل متواصل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires proficiency in C++ for plugin development","Limited to Clang and LLVM infrastructure","Dependent on clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry and other LLVM libraries"],"zh":["需要C++编程能力用于插件开发","仅限于Clang和LLVM基础设施","依赖于clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry和其他LLVM库"],"ja":["プラグイン開発のためのC++プログラミング能力の必要性","ClangおよびLLVMインフラストラクチャのみのサポート","clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistryおよびその他のLLVMライブラリへの依存"],"ko":["플러그인 개발을 위한 C++ 프로그래밍 능력의 필요성","Clang 및 LLVM 인프라스트럭처만 지원","clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry 및 기타 LLVM 라이브러리에 대한 의존"],"es":["Requiere competencia en C++ para el desarrollo de plugins","Limitado a la infraestructura de Clang y LLVM","Dependiente de clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry y otras bibliotecas de LLVM"],"fr":["Nécessite une compétence en C++ pour le développement de plugins","Limité à l''infrastructure Clang et LLVM","Dépendant de clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry et d''autres bibliothèques LLVM"],"de":["Erfordert Kenntnisse in C++ für die Plugin-Entwicklung","Begrenzt auf die Clang- und LLVM-Infrastruktur","Abhängig von clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry und anderen LLVM-Bibliotheken"],"pt":["Exige proficiência em C++ para desenvolvimento de plugins","Limitado à infraestrutura do Clang e do LLVM","Dependente de clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry e outras bibliotecas do LLVM"],"ru":["Требует профессионализма в C++ для разработки плагинов","Ограничен инфраструктурой Clang и LLVM","Зависит от clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry и других библиотек LLVM"],"ar":["يتطلب إتقان لغة C++ لتطوير الملحقات","محدود ببنية تحتية Clang و LLVM","يعتمد على clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry ومكتبات LLVM الأخرى"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"382d6821ce259cd3d39184233072f00c3a7ae84d222c1de1f4df76e070e33d6e","qualityScore":39}');
